    "note": "Deterministic mapping vectors pinning the Entra ID sign-in record -> raucle chain-event mapping against drift. Each vector publishes the raw Graph record, the expected chain event, its canonical UTF-8 serialisation (sort_keys, compact separators), and the sha256 over those bytes. A mapping change must advance this JSON deliberately; tests/test_connectors_entra.py reproduces every vector live and refuses silent divergence. Fixtures live in tests/fixtures/entra_sign_ins/.",
    "action_derivation": "signin.success when status.errorCode == 0; signin.error.<code> otherwise; records without a status object keep action null. createdDateTime is copied verbatim.",
    "actor_attribution": "known requires an evidenced principal name (userPrincipalName or servicePrincipalName); id included only when the record carries userId/servicePrincipalId. id-name-only records map to unknown id_without_identifier; no-principal records to missing_actor_identity."
